{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39766","headline":"明月照高楼 · 黄滔","name":"明月照高楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月满长空朗，楼侵碧落横。\n波文流藻井，桂魄拂雕楹。\n深鉴罗纨薄，寒搜户牖清。\n冰铺梁燕噤，霜覆瓦松倾。\n卓午收全影，斜悬转半明。\n佳人当此夕，多少别离情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39766.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39766","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}